  "releaseNotes": "v2025.4.04.01:\n      - Added generic deserialization methods to REST APIs (GetAsync<T>, PostAsync<TReq,TRes>, etc.)\n      - Added configurable error reporting via ApiClientOptions.EnableErrorReporting\n      - Refactored ServiceCollectionExtensions to eliminate code duplication\n      - Changed service lifetimes from Scoped to Transient for better compatibility\n      - Removed empty IDisposable implementations\n      - Fire-and-forget error reporting for non-blocking SQS messages\n      - Comprehensive README.md and XML documentation with examples\n      - 38 new unit tests for generic methods and configuration",
